{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "50f77244-9964-836e-803f-f494966b986a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T14:34:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sean Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:30:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:30:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good afternoon. Um, I'm calling about cats. A bunch of stray cats, I think they're feral, over by some dumpsters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:30:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Feral cats. Okay, hon, where is this happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:30:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 472 Carroll Avenue, in the Fifth Ward. The dumpsters are around the side of the building there, kind of in the back lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:30:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm the homeowner, so I'm there every day, and it's been getting worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four seventy-two Carroll. Got it. And how many cats are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I counted at least seven yesterday. Maybe more. They kind of live back there, under the pallets by the dumpsters. I think it's a colony now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:31:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Seven. Oh my. That adds up fast, doesn't it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:31:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it does. And honestly that's what I'm worried about, there are kids around. A few families nearby, and the kids cut through that lot to get to the bus in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cut through the lot to the bus. Okay. Have any of the cats been aggressive, has anybody been scratched or bitten?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:31:44-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, not yet. Not that I know of. But a couple of them look sick, like their eyes are crusty. And if a kid goes to pet one, you know? Not yet, is what I keep thinking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:31:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet, right. That's a good reason to call it in now. Do you think the storm last weekend pushed them around at all? Everybody's been a little rattled since Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:32:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe. Since the storm, Friday into Saturday, there's more of them out in the open, like they lost wherever they were hiding. Three days ago, so it's been since then I noticed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:32:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since the storm, that makes sense. They go looking for shelter and food. So is somebody putting food out, or is it just the dumpsters?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:32:37-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the dumpsters, I think. Somebody leaves the lid up. I wish it were a simple fix, honestly, I'm already stretched. My holiday bonus came in smaller than I figured, so I can't really just hire somebody to deal with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:32:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry, that's a letdown. Well, you don't need to hire anybody. I'm going to take down the details and get this to animal control so an officer can look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:33:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Animal control. Okay, that's good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:33:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me make sure I have it right. Seven or more cats, near the dumpsters behind four seventy-two Carroll Avenue, kids walking through to the bus, a couple look ill, no one hurt. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:33:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's it. Oh, should I stay away from them? Like, should I do anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:33:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stay away from them, yes, and tell the kids not to touch them. Don't try to trap anything yourself. Leave that to the officer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:33:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Don't try to trap anything. Right. Okay. Will somebody call me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:33:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They might. What's a good callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:33:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:33:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Five five five, zero one eight two. Perfect. I can't promise a day, but it'll go in today, and I'll mark it as children in the area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:34:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Children in the area. Thank you, that helps. I just don't want something to happen before anyone looks at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:34:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. You did the right thing calling. You take care, Sean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Sandra. Bye."
    }
  ],
